      en: ["Onne Port is home to the world's first dedicated Oil and Gas Free Trade Zone.", "The port is located along the Bonny River in Rivers State, within the Niger Delta.", "It comprises the Federal Ocean Terminal and the Federal Lighter Terminal.", "Onne serves as the primary support base for offshore oil activities in West Africa.", "More than 200 international companies operate within the Onne Free Zone.", "The port features one of the deepest navigational channels in the entire region."],
